{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/bfff1cc672adf7c616cc9ee975917352.avif?t=1758160233\" width=384 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the Whispers of Zark:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sacrifice from the Kingdom of Blue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The star in the sky, timely falling through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic encompassing, banishes the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/7e9bdd14dcf7d3a0dbc01b6f062e17ea.avif?t=1758160233\" width=480 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85+ magical and unique items to discover and craft</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tome beckons. Inspect items at the Tome to discover new traits. Transfer traits during crafting to create the ultimate item...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mastery over items as you practice your craft. Equip stronger tools, level up and collect higher and higher quality items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/312c40a189184b12ad1ec3841f005de6.avif?t=1758160233\" width=368 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock 3 different areas, each with a day and night cycle to find specific items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the days slip by. Manage your energy, time and items as you travel across the lands to gain knowledge and FILL UP YOUR CHEST.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/f3a0923e90aa8f53f8a47e32909a2a76.avif?t=1758160233\" width=368 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game develops, I'm hoping to add 3 new areas for the mid-game story and finalize it with 3 more areas for the end game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the explorable areas triple, I'm anticipating the number of items to triple, bringing us to a total of 300+ items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day and night cycle is the first step for the varied exploration system. I want to bring a weather system to complement the day and night to keep things interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001700?t=1758160233","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/cb04f0b7637ab0adb0a81ef347347b2a72c5b1e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758160233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/98ac4105d6c87ed80083a4b65f896803c2d49caa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758160233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/98ac4105d6c87ed80083a4b65f896803c2d49caa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758160233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/bfff1cc672adf7c616cc9ee975917352.avif?t=1758160233\" width=384 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the Whispers of Zark:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sacrifice from the Kingdom of Blue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The star in the sky, timely falling through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic encompassing, banishes the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/7e9bdd14dcf7d3a0dbc01b6f062e17ea.avif?t=1758160233\" width=480 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85+ magical and unique items to discover and craft</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tome beckons. Inspect items at the Tome to discover new traits. Transfer traits during crafting to create the ultimate item...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain mastery over items as you practice your craft. Equip stronger tools, level up and collect higher and higher quality items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/312c40a189184b12ad1ec3841f005de6.avif?t=1758160233\" width=368 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock 3 different areas, each with a day and night cycle to find specific items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the days slip by. Manage your energy, time and items as you travel across the lands to gain knowledge and FILL UP YOUR CHEST.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/extras/f3a0923e90aa8f53f8a47e32909a2a76.avif?t=1758160233\" width=368 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game develops, I'm hoping to add 3 new areas for the mid-game story and finalize it with 3 more areas for the end game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the explorable areas triple, I'm anticipating the number of items to triple, bringing us to a total of 300+ items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day and night cycle is the first step for the varied exploration system. I want to bring a weather system to complement the day and night to keep things interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ByePidgeon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001700/ac1784fed5f7ce52c2718eb77c4b9f0bd1cee655/header.jpg?t=1758160233","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257193429,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193429/movie480.mp4?t=1757614505","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193429/movie_max.mp4?t=1757614505"},"name":"Cauldron Craft Trailer 0","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193429/aaee4589cf0120e3ac7ebf7c1808b21bfbec1de8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757614505","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193429/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757614505","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193429/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757614505"}}],"name":"Cauldron Craft","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 670 / Radeon HD 7970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":t